Z||000000||grinthock||11-02-2001||07:34 PM||||Hey everyone, stock 87 GT, my ENTIRE exhaust system is SHOT.<P>Any ideas?  I was told by a VERY good local muffler shop that there is no real replacement for the stock fiero muffler.  Due to how short it is......<P>What have you guys/gals done?   Pics?<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! <BR>Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||11-02-2001||07:53 PM||||I got a Borla system when they were available.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||grinthock||11-02-2001||08:00 PM||||I read by in the logs, some people were talking about it being produced again.. Any word on that?  There was a walker system here in canada anyone used that?||||reg||1
Z||000003||80's BOY||11-02-2001||08:46 PM||||go to your muffler shop and have them re-do your entire exhaust system. cut off the cat, and in its place put a single-chamber flowmaster or a turbo-type muffler. just take some measurements and go from there. then construct the rest of the exhaust by y'ing off into 2 outlets (6cyl).<BR>if it's done right the flow should equalize to both pipes evenly. hope all you emissions dorks don't get your panties in a wad over this. it worked great for me. i have resonated tips for added backpressure. DO NOT put in a straight glasspack unless you want to lose your low-end torque off the line. i had one and cut it off the next week for the flowmaster.||||reg||2
Z||000004||JohnF||11-02-2001||08:55 PM||||If I remember correctly, Canada is much worse regarding cats than the U.S.  <P>Check out the Fiero Store - complete systems from the cat fwd for $219.  <P>So, the original system IS still available!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Jeff Blowers||11-02-2001||09:03 PM||||Also, I have seen the Fiero Store advertising a system from Ocelot that is a complete replacement from the cat back.||||reg||1
Z||000006||grinthock||11-02-2001||09:40 PM||||Seems close to the offers here, Walker system from cat to the tips for like $400 Canadain installed.  NO Actual tips.<P>My other car has a good exhaust system maybe I will pull it and install iut on my 87||||reg||1
